'''Frozen''' is an unreleased knife that was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]] made for the [[Christmas Event 2022|2022 Christmas Event]]. It was rumored to make an appearance later on during the event, though never releasing in the end.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Frozen Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name which also currently remains unreleased.

